    <string name="compass_help_title">About the Compass</string>
    <string name="compass_help_line1">• Hold the phone flat, screen up. The line at the top marks where you are pointing, and the number in the center is your heading.</string>
    <string name="compass_help_line2">• The red N always points to magnetic north, which can differ from true north by a few degrees depending on where you are.</string>
    <string name="compass_help_line3">• If the accuracy indicator drops, move the phone in a figure-8 until it shows high again. Keep away from magnets, speakers and metal objects.</string>
    <string name="compass_help_line4">• Tap Lock bearing to save the direction you are facing. The compass shows how far and which way to turn, and vibrates when you are back on course.</string>

    <string name="compass_onboarding_hint">Hold the phone flat. Tap Lock bearing to keep a direction while you walk.</string>

